  "limitations": [
    "Original parsed public Run on unchanged077 production panicked on typed503 after five parallel-route GETs and about0.6s for both epoch and pool routes. Baseline normal retains that actual behavior. The race overlay restores only the two original SDK calls under the new graceful-error boundary so all current test sources still compile; it is not an unchanged full-file race rerun.",
    "The first ecd fixture incorrectly assumed two status responses exhausted the SDK. Parallel attempts reached recovery with five reads and its cardinality assertion failed. baseline-public-normal and the exact first test source are retained, explicitly excluded from product causal evidence. The corrected fixture sustains sixteen unavailable responses; success is based on actual verified command output and no mutation requests, not guessed route count.",
    "Nine selected roots normal/race exercise both actual public parsed commands, real SDK65-second logical outages in each read, original300-second budget exhaustion, typed joined-cause precedence, terminal HTTP/JSON/null/epoch refusal, and cancellation before effects, during request and during retry wait. Logical time advances only after completed real reads; no65-second wall wait is claimed.",
    "Only epoch and pool GETs enter the retry owner. Proof verification, signing and the single onchain.Submit call are outside it. Tests provide no key or RPC for public commands and perform no signed submission or live action; source scope does not independently qualify the signing branch.",
    "Frozen server10a/Connect0a graph only. Current server/module adoption, independent qualification, full miner/release and deployment remain separate."
  ],
